Fetch a git crate from an archive of its locked commit

A git crate's repository is cloned with its submodules, which can dwarf the
crates themselves. A crate annotation may instead name an archive of the
locked commit, pinned by its SHA-256, to download in place of the clone.

License: Apache-2.0 (rules_rs 0.0.112)

